Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他爱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你爱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我们爱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎贝丝 再读一遍\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}One more time, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎很好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎再来一遍\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字来着\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hey. What's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎她叫贝丝 废材\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's Beth, nimrod.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎行吧 贝丝废材 待会儿有空吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Right. Well, Beth Nimrod, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎现在有空吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You know, like, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.45,0:01:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎原来你是棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're the chess player.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎没错\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎美国女子公开赛冠军\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}US Women's Champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎美国公开赛双冠军\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}US Open Co-Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你肯定没想到吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Must be a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎是啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.87,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-你会下棋吗  ‎-不会 太烧脑了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Do you play? - No, too cerebral.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-但我常玩大富翁  ‎-我倒没玩过\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Played a lot of Monopoly, though. - Never played that game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎别玩 玩了会变成资本主义的奴隶\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mm, don't. It makes you a slave to capitalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.95,0:01:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我到现在还梦想赚大钱呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I-I still dream about making money, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎既然你是资本主义的奴隶 ‎为什么还要上俄语课呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So, why are you taking Russian classes if you're a slave to capitalism?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我想读懂陀思妥耶夫斯基的原著\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I wanna read Dostoevsky in the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"‎你真的喜欢我的身材吗"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}"You really like the shape of me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我嗑嗨了 不该跟你说外语\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm stoned. I shouldn't be speaking a foreign language.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我应该给家里打个电话\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And I should probably call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎电话在卧室里 穿过厨房就到了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Phone's in the bedroom, through the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎谢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎喂\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就是跟你说一声 ‎我跟几个俄语班认识的朋友\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hey, I just wanted to let you know that I'm with some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎待在一起\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}From my Russian class.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你去睡吧 我带了钥匙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Go on to bed. I've got a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你是说你在跟大学生在一起玩吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Did you say you're partying with college students?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎对啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎好吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎亲爱的 别乱抽烟\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Just be careful what you smoke, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎知道了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.45,0:03:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎明早见\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}See you in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎有没有遇到想要...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Is there anyone you've met that you'd like to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,... "切磋"的对象呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}... trade rooks with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎天啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那个点燃的紫色蜡烛是什么玩意儿\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What's that burning purple thing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你说啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎还要多久\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-就快了  -好吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- I'm close. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎不好意思 我嗑得太嗨了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm sorry, I'm just really stoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我也是\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"大家都去了辛辛那提看电影"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}"Everybody went to Cincinnati to see a movie."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎"想待多久随便你"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}"Stay as long as you like."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你应该打个电话的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You might have called.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎抱歉 我不想吵醒你\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm sorry. Didn't wanna wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-‎没关系的  -‎总之 我没事\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- I wouldn't have minded. - Anyways, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我要去辛辛那提...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm going to Cincinnati...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎看一场电影\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}to see a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎今晚也不会回家\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So, I won't be home tonight, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我会在周一放学后回家\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll be home after school Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你是不是跟男生在一起\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Are you with a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎昨晚是的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I was last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎天啊 贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Oh, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我没事 我...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm all right. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我玩得很开心\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}had a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎毕竟下棋只是人生中的一部分\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Well, chess isn't the only thing in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-只是...  ‎-我不会怀孕的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- It's just... - I won't get pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听你胡扯\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Famous last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎‎伊丽莎白·哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Elizabeth Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎恭喜你\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我真以你为荣\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎好了 快打开看看\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}All right, open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎是一只宝路华腕表\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's a Bulova.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎太美了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎谢谢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定要出席几个毕业派对吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I suppose you'll be going to a grad night party or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我不去了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我们两周后要去墨西哥城比赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We have Mexico City in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎然后是全美锦标赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And then the US Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎接着是雷米·瓦伦酒店比赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And then Remy-Vallon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎在巴黎\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}In Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎巴黎\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我被邀请参赛了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They invited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎巴黎\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎天啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我们的期待开始逐一成真了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Things are beginning to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-麻烦再给我一杯啤酒  ‎-好的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Another cerveza, por favor. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-在看什么  ‎-兵型结构分析\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- What are you reading about? - Pawn structure analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎听起来很有意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sounds exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎是啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我有件事要跟你坦白\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I have a confession to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你知道笔友吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Do you know what a pen pal is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎就是有书信来往的朋友\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Someone you exchange letters with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎没错\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-惠特利太太 你的啤酒来了  ‎-谢谢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Your beer, Ms. Wheatley. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎其实...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我还在读高中的时候 西语老师给了我们一个名单\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}when I was in high school, my Spanish class was given a list
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎上面都是学习英语的墨西哥男生\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}of boys in Mexico who were studying English.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我选了一个男生 然后‎寄了一封自我介绍信\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I picked one, and I sent him a letter about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我们通信很久了 即便在我嫁给奥斯顿之后也没断过\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We corresponded for a rather long time, even when I was married to Allston.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我们还交换了照片\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We exchanged photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他叫曼努埃尔\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}His name is Manuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他会到机场接我们\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He's meeting us at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你们见过面吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Have you ever met him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎没有\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎说真的 我很激动\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I have to say, I am really quite thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你想提早来墨西哥就是为了他吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Is he the reason you wanted to come to Mexico early?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我想是吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎拉美史 ‎艺术史和政治史上的所有名人\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Every single famous person in Latin-American history,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎都来过墨西哥城\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}art or politics, has sometime come to Mexico City.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎可以理解为什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I can see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-这座城市真漂亮  -‎是啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- It's lovely. - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我常说 我出生在墨西哥...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I like to say that I was born in Mexico...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎事实上 我出生在墨西哥城\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}but I am from Mexico City.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.41,0:13:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你刚到吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You just get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎几天前就到了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}A few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-你们不是不再比赛了吗  ‎-我不比了 但迈克就爱找罪受\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- I thought you were done with tournaments. - I am. Mike's a glutton for punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-是啊  ‎-你妈交了个新朋友\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Yeah. - Your mom has a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.83,0:13:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她今天凌晨三点才回来 昨天是凌晨两点半\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She came in at three o'clock this morning, 2:30 the day before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他开一辆绿色道奇跑车带着她四处兜风\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He's got a green Dodge that always seems to be at her disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这周天天共进午餐和晚餐\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And they've had lunch and dinner every day this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定上过床了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm pretty sure they're fucking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎起初我以为是因为地势较高\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I thought, at first, it was the altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎海拔约有2240米\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}7,350 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎天啊 足以令人目眩神迷\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Good lord, it's enough to make a person positively giddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎如今我倒认为是文化的驱使\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Now, I think it's the culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.87,0:13:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎墨西哥完全没有新教伦理的痕迹\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's no hint of a Protestant ethic in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他们都信仰拉丁天主教\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They're all Latin Catholics,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎都活在当下\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and they all live in the here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎劝你别再读艾伦·瓦兹{\fs18}[英国哲学家]{\r}的书了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You really need to stop reading Alan Watts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎听着都烦人\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我打算喝一杯玛格丽特再出门\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I think I'll have just one margarita before I go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎帮我叫人送上来吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Will you call for one, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-前台  -麻烦送一杯玛格丽特和一瓶可乐上来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Recepción. - Yes, could we get a margarita and a Coke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-请告诉我房号  ‎-713号\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Room number? - 713.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-马上送到  ‎-谢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Coming soon. - Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你可以跟我一起去学习墨西哥民俗舞\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You know you could come along to the folklórico.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.41,0:14:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我知道光是舞衣就跟门票一样贵了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I understand the costumes alone are worth the price of admission.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-今天天气真好  ‎-这两天都下雨\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- It's such a beautiful day. - It's been raining the last two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎是吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我没发现呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I hadn't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎明天比赛就开始了 ‎我要研究一下这些残局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The tournament starts tomorrow. I need to work on these endgames.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎贝丝 其实你更应该为自己着想一下\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You know, perhaps, Beth, you have to work on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎下棋只是人生的一部分\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Chess is not all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我只懂得下棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.95,0:14:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎经验告诉我 你懂得的东西不一定重要\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}My experience has taught me what you know isn't always what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那什么才重要\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And what's important?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.41,0:14:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎生活和成长\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Living and growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎活出精彩\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Living your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-比如跟一个俗气的墨西哥推销员交往吗  -‎善待自己 到处冒险\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- With a sleazy Mexican salesman. - Treating yourself. Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你还没去过艺术宫和查普尔特佩克公园呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You haven't visited Bellas Artes, or even been to Chapultepec Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那边的动物园很好玩\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The zoo there is delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你三餐都在房里解决\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You've taken all of your meals in this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎整天埋首研读棋艺书\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}you've had your nose buried in a chess book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎比赛前一天不是应该放松一下吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Shouldn't you just relax the day before the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎考虑做一些跟下棋无关的事吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Think about something other than chess?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎妈妈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎明早10点 ‎我将以黑方跟奥克塔维奥·玛伦可对弈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Tomorrow, at ten o'clock, I play black against Octavio Marenco.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那意味着他主导开局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That means he gets to move first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我知道黑方意味着什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes. I know what playing black means.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他在全球排名第34位 也是国际特级大师\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He's 34 and an International Grandmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎要是我输了 这趟行程...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If I lose, we'll be paying for this trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这场冒险...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}this adventure...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎就超支了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}out of capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎要是我赢了 ‎下午就要跟比玛伦可更出色的选手对弈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If I win, I'll be playing someone even better than Marenco in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我需要研究残局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I need to study my endgame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎外界都说你是靠直觉下棋的 对吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're what they call an intuitive player, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎对啊 有人这么说过我\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, I have been called that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎有时那些步法会像灵光般闪现\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sometimes, the moves come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我发现人们最欣赏你的步法\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've noticed the moves they applaud the loudest
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.16,0:15:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎都是你当下使出的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}are the ones you make rather quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎每次走那步棋时 ‎你都会露出某种表情\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And there's a certain look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你在书里可找不到直觉\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Intuition can't be found in books.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我觉得你只是不喜欢曼努埃尔\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I think you just don't like Manuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我对曼努埃尔没意见\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Manuel is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎但我知道他来不是为了见我\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}But he doesn't come by to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那是两码事\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That's irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你应该放松一下\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You need to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你是世界上最有天分的棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's no player in the world as gifted as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我不知道一个出色的棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I haven't the remotest idea what faculties a person needs
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎需要具备什么能力\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}in order to play chess well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎但我相信放松绝对能带来进步\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}but I am convinced that relaxation can only improve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-给我一杯科罗娜啤酒. -好的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Una cerveza Corona, por favor. - Sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你这种人会过得很辛苦\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}People like you have a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎凡事一体两面\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Two sides of the same coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你有天分...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You've got your gift...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎... 但这种天分需要你付出代价\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}... and you've got what it costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我不知道你要付出的代价是什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hard to say for you what that will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你的人生会有平步青云的时候 ‎但这会持续多久呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You'll have your time in the sun, but for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你心里有太多愤怒了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You've got so much anger in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你要小心\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You'll have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Cerveza?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.25,0:17:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎开始吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Let's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎操\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎开灯吧 我醒了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You can turn on the light. I'm now awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎抱歉\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我好像感冒了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I seem to have caught a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎不知道能不能看你明早的比赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't know if I'll be able to watch your match in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎不要紧的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可以赛后转述给我听吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You'll tell me all about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.95,0:19:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎可以\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎每一步都不能漏\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Every move?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎没问题\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hi, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-你好  ‎-你好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎今晚很适合游泳\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Lovely night for a swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我是胡安·阿尔贝托·迪亚斯\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}This is Juan Alberto Diaz
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在阿兹台克宫酒店举办的墨西哥城国际象棋邀请赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}coming to you live from the Mexico City Invitational Chess Tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.33,0:20:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,为各位观众做现场报导\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}at the Palacio Azteca where
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这场赛事的焦点是一名17岁的棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}the big story has been the seventeen-year-old
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来自肯塔基州列克星敦的伊丽莎白·哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}from Lexington, Kentucky, Elizabeth Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.37,0:20:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我们都不懂对方的语言\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Neither of us spoke the other's language.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他第一步就将王兵移到王线第四格\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He opened with a pawn to king four.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我则将后兵移到后翼象线第四格应对\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I played pawn to queen's bishop four.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我在31步内就把他包围在将杀网里了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}In 31 moves, I had his king in a mating net.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.41,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你真是天才\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're a wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.41,0:21:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这位一路过关斩将的棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Undefeated, this morning she played
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎今早以拒后翼弃兵开局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}the Queen's Gambit Declined
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.50,0:21:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎对战奥地利棋手戴德里克\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}against the Austrian, Diedrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎后者中局面对接踵而至的压力\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Facing relentless pressure in the middle of the board,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎因为哈蒙一开局就步步逼近\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Harmon had him on his heels from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎她的步法多数以兵为主\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She did it mostly with pawns,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎轻而易举便攻破了他的棋局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and crushed his position as one might crush an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎戴德里克向来表现得很好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Diedrich played well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎从未失策或是走错一步\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}made no blunders or anything that could properly be called a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎但哈蒙的步法精准无误 招招致命\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}but Harmon moved with such deadly accuracy, such measured control,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎在对手精准到位的步法下\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}that his position was hopeless
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,戴德里克在第23步就败下阵来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}by the 23rd move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这名少女的棋艺确实惊人\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Impressive play by this young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.41,0:22:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎博戈夫撤了马\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Borgov retreats his knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎实则是要攻黑方的马\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}but he's really attacking the black knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.95,0:22:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这是个非常有趣的棋局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}This is a very interesting position.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.04,0:22:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎对双方都不利\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It is dangerous for both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎黑方该怎么应对呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How is Black going to answer the threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.83,0:22:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎是进是退\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Will he defend himself or counter attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.37,0:22:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎两者皆有可能\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It could go either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎妈妈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我在外面\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎呼吸新鲜空气 感觉不错吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Fresh air feels nice, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.29,0:23:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你不出门吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Aren't you going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.79,0:23:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎不了 曼努埃尔今晚不来了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No, Manuel's not coming tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.37,0:23:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他要去瓦哈卡出差\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He had business in Oaxaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要去多久\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How long will he be gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.25,0:23:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎直到我们离开为止\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}At least until we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我替你感到难过\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我没去过瓦哈卡 可是...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've never been to Oaxaca, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那里应该跟丹佛一样吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I imagine it resembles Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.91,0:23:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我们一起吃晚餐吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We can have dinner together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你可以带我去你去过的地方\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You can take me to one of the places you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.00,0:23:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎好啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎还在一起的时候最美好了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It was fun while it lasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.33,0:23:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,‎下午好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我是乔治·格雷夫\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I am Georgi Girev.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:23:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我是贝丝·哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.41,0:24:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎幸会\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎五个小时过去了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's been five hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.25,0:25:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我建议封棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Perhaps we should adjourn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.79,0:25:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你一定要封棋了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You must seal your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.91,0:25:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎哈蒙小姐必须马上封棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Miss Harmon must seal her move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.16,0:25:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这局棋明早10点继续 ‎赶在你们的常规比赛之前\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Play will resume tomorrow at ten, before your regular matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎哈蒙小姐\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Miss Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.83,0:26:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎什么事\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.33,0:26:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎可以问你一件事吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}May I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我听说美国有一种坐在车上看电影的地方\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}In America, I'm told that one sees films inside the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.87,0:26:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎是真的吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.29,0:26:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎汽车影院\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Drive-ins.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你是指汽车影院吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You mean drive-in movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.12,0:26:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎对 看猫王主演的电影\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, Elvis Presley movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.12,0:26:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎看黛比·雷诺兹和伊丽莎白·泰勒主演的电影...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Debbie Reynolds and Elizabeth Taylor...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.66,0:26:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎有那种地方吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎有的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.00,0:26:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎真想去体验一下\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I would dig that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.20,0:27:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎兵走到车线第五格\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Pawn to rook five.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.75,0:29:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎为了你 贝丝·哈蒙...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}For you, Beth Harmon...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.16,0:29:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我采取老式方法认输\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I resign the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.41,0:29:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎其实我也没去过汽车影院\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've never been to a drive-in, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.83,0:30:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我不应该建议你封棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I should not have let you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.12,0:30:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你走了车\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}With the rook.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.66,0:30:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你错了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.62,0:30:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎就算有下一次 你还是会做同样的决定\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}But you won't let the next one that tries it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.87,0:30:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你几岁开始下棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How old were you when you started playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.00,0:30:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎四岁\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.70,0:30:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我七岁就成了分区冠军\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I was district champion at seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.66,0:30:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎总有一天我会成为世界冠军\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I will be world champion one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.70,0:30:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那天是什么时候\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.83,0:30:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎三年后\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}In three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.20,0:30:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎到时你已经16岁了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You'll be 16 in three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.75,0:30:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎要是你真的赢了...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If you win...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.70,0:30:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎下一步怎么办\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}what will you do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.50,0:30:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我没听懂你的问题\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I-I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.37,0:30:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎如果你16岁就成为世界冠军...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If you're world champion at 16...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.54,0:30:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎接下来想怎么过你的人生\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}what will you do with the rest of your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我还是没听懂\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.62,0:31:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你是我遇见过最强的对手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're the best I've ever played.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.91,0:31:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你还没跟博戈夫对弈呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Until you play Borgov.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.70,0:32:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.50,0:32:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎瞧我发现了什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.54,0:32:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎各位 这位是全美国际象棋冠军‎伊丽莎白·哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Everyone, this is Elizabeth Harmon, the US Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.00,0:32:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎双冠军\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Co-Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.62,0:32:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎抱歉 我错过了你的比赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm sorry I missed your match,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.87,0:32:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎泡热水澡太舒服了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}but the bath was so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.33,0:32:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我一下午都泡在浴缸里\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I soaked the entire afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.16,0:32:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我很开心\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-你看起来精神多了  -‎感觉也好多了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- You look better. - I feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.50,0:32:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-饿了吗  ‎-快饿死了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Are you hungry? - Starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.25,0:32:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 这位女士 你弹得真好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you. You play beautiful, señora.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.08,0:32:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.62,0:33:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你不是说你怯场得厉害吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So much for your stage fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.20,0:33:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎只要没有压力 我就能弹得很好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I play fine as long as it's for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.12,0:33:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎要去哪里呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Where shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.00,0:33:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要不就去你刚去过的地方吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Any one of the new places you've been to?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.00,0:33:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎还是回房吃吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Let's eat in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.37,0:33:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎如果是在莫斯科 ‎她肯定还在倒时差 我们可以杀她个片甲不留\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}In Moscow, she'll be jet-lagged. We can destroy her then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.62,0:33:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎她进步了很多\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She's getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.62,0:34:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎必须在这里或者巴黎解决了她\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Have to deal with her here or in Paris
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.16,0:34:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不然她会越来越强\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}before she gets too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.79,0:34:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎听说她是个酒鬼\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's talk she's a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.75,0:34:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎只会一味地进攻\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Her game is almost all attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.50,0:34:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎很少留意防御\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So she doesn't always watch her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.08,0:34:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎每次粗心犯错她都会生气\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}When she blunders, she gets angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.54,0:34:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她一生气就危险了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and can be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.54,0:34:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-跟所有女人一样  -‎她是个孤儿 ‎一个幸存者\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Like all women. - She's an orphan. A survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.75,0:34:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎跟我们一样... 所以只能赢不能输\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She's like us... Losing is not an option for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.12,0:34:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,‎不然她的人生还能怎么过\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Otherwise, what would her life be?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.54,0:35:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那两个男人分别是世界排名第一和第二的棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Those two guys, they're number two and three in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.33,0:35:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-那些人是谁  ‎-克格勃\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- And those guys? - KGB.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.33,0:35:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎确保博戈夫不会逃跑\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Make sure Borgov doesn't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.33,0:35:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎可以帮我给我妈留个位子吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Will you save a seat for my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.58,0:35:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-好  ‎-好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.91,0:35:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你可以启动对手的棋钟了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You may start your opponent's clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.83,0:35:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎王兵开局 王线第四格\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Pawn to king four.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.95,0:36:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎她经常以西西里防御开局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She always plays the Sicilian to that opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.70,0:36:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这是国际象棋中白方最常见的开局方法\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's the most common opening for White in the game of chess,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.58,0:36:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎但是博戈夫被称为"西西里防御大师"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and Borgov has been called the "Master of the Sicilian."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.04,0:36:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎哈蒙将兵移向后翼象线第四格\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Harmon moves pawn to queen bishop four,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.25,0:36:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎借此给双方来点新意\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}hoping to play him on ground that's fresh for both of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.54,0:36:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎确保他没有机会凭借丰富的经验占据上风\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}that won't give him the advantage of his superior knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.20,0:36:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎现在博戈夫将王翼马移到象线第三格\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And now Borgov has brought out his king's knight to bishop three,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.50,0:36:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,... 而‎哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}... and Harmon,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.54,0:36:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,自然会将王翼马移到后翼象线第三格\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}of course, brings hers to queen bishop three,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎进攻中央战场\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}attacking the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.37,0:36:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这时博戈夫的象走到马线第五格\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}But Borgov moves his bishop to knight five,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.29,0:36:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎暗示他要使出封闭式西西里\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}signaling he's going to play the Closed Sicilian,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.29,0:36:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎而非开放式西西里\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}not the Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.25,0:36:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,‎请勿打扰棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Please do not disturb the players.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎罗索里莫变例 一种少见的开局法...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The Rossolimo. A rare opening...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.33,0:37:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,‎哈蒙将兵移往车线第三格\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Harmon pushes her pawn
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.08,0:37:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,进攻博戈夫的象\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}to rook three, attacking Borgov's bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.37,0:37:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎博戈夫使出王车易位\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Borgov castles.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.20,0:37:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这时哈蒙必须决定\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Harmon must now decide
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.16,0:37:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要开放棋局还是维持封闭\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}to open the game or keep it closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.37,0:37:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎白方占有优势\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}White has the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.70,0:37:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎毕竟由白方开局 ‎走第一步通常都占有优势\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Since it always has the first move, it always has the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.75,0:37:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我是看电脑对弈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I read that when computers learn to play chess,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.20,0:37:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好几次后发现的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and play against other computers,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.04,0:37:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎白方总是胜出 因为白方走第一步\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}White will always win because of the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.41,0:37:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎就像三连棋一样\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Like tic-tac-toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.25,0:37:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎博戈夫不是机器\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Borgov's not a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.30,0:37:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那可不一定\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That you know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.95,0:38:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎真没想到\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I didn't expect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.12,0:38:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎这根本不是个棋局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No one really plays it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.66,0:38:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎搞得我不知所措\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It threw me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎一切好像都在他的掌控之中\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Just like he knew it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.45,0:38:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎从那一刻开始 结局似乎就定下了 我...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}From that point on, the whole game was like a foregone conclusion. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.12,0:39:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我无法抗拒这种败局已定的感觉\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I couldn't fight this feeling that I'd already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎就像书里描述的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Like in the books,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.91,0:39:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎结局已定 但我们还是不想就此罢手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}where you know the outcome, but you play it out
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.08,0:39:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎只是为了看过程 而且...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}just to see how it would happen, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.54,0:39:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他走的每一步都...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I mean, every move he made was so...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.58,0:39:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎精准有力 都...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}obvious, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.95,0:39:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎超乎想象 而且步步为营\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}unimaginative, so bureaucratic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.29,0:39:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎整场比赛我都在观察他的表情\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And the whole time, I'd look at his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.70,0:39:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎他没有露出一丝疑惑\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and there was no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.25,0:39:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎也看不出破绽\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.58,0:39:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎幸好你没去观赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm so glad you didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.95,0:39:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎妈妈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.58,0:40:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,‎节哀顺变\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.91,0:40:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎死因是什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.00,0:40:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎可能是肝炎\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hepatitis, possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.66,0:40:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎明天就知道了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We will know tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.70,0:40:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎可以给我开镇静剂吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Could you give me a tranquilizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.95,0:40:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-我可以给你开安眠药  ‎-我不要安眠药\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Yes. I have a sedative. - I don't want a sedative.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.41,0:40:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,‎可以给我开利眠宁{\fs18}[抗精神失常药]{\r}吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Could I have a prescription for Librium?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.29,0:40:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎在墨西哥买利眠宁不需要处方\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You don't need a prescription to buy Librium in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.41,0:40:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我建议你服用眠尔通{\fs18}[抗焦虑药]{\r}\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I suggest meprobamate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.87,0:40:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎酒店里就有一家药房\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's a farmacia here in the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.58,0:40:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎请容我再说一遍 节哀顺变\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Again, I'm very sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.16,0:41:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎请允许我们帮你处理后事\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Allow us to help you with any arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.62,0:41:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎例如签署必要文件 跟执法单位沟通\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Signing papers, dealing with authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.04,0:41:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎当然 我们也会支付相关费用\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And, of course, the bill will be taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.54,0:41:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-谢了  -‎包括高额的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Thank you. - Including the liquor bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.41,0:41:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,酒水账单\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}which was significant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.87,0:41:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,‎但我相信你的母亲骤然离世\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Though, I'm sure none of the many margaritas she consumed
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.83,0:41:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎绝对跟她大量饮用玛格丽特无关\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}was the culprit in your mother's untimely passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.00,0:41:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎她确实抱怨过你们的龙舌兰质量不好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She did mention something about the quality of the tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.66,0:41:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎请容我再说一遍...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Again...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.29,0:41:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我们会竭尽所能帮助你\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}whatever we can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.87,0:41:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我一定要找到他\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I need to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.91,0:42:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎喂\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.25,0:42:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎有你的电话\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I have your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.29,0:42:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,从丹佛打来的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}From Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.91,0:42:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎谢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.83,0:42:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我是奥斯顿·惠特利\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}This is Allston Wheatley.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.62,0:42:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,‎惠特利先生 我是贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's Beth, Mr. Wheatley.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.87,0:42:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.37,0:42:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎也就是你女儿\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.62,0:42:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-伊丽莎白·哈蒙  ‎-你在墨西哥吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Elizabeth Harmon. - And you're in Mexico?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.87,0:42:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我想跟你说惠特利太太的事\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's about Mrs. Wheatley.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.20,0:42:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎艾玛怎么了 她在你旁边吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How is Alma? Is she there with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.41,0:42:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎她去世了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.00,0:42:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎今早去世的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She died this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.79,0:42:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-惠特利先生...  ‎-你能替我料理她的后事吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Mr. Wheatley... - Can't you handle this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.62,0:42:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我去不了墨西哥\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I-I can't be going off to Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.70,0:42:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,‎明早法医会验尸 我必须买两张机票...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's an autopsy in the morning, and I have to buy new plane tickets...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.58,0:42:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我是说 我必须给自己买一张机票\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I mean, I have to get a new ticket for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.95,0:42:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,‎-我不知道要把她葬在哪里  ‎-找列克星敦的杜金兄弟吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- I don't know where to bury her. - Call Durgin Brothers in Lexington.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.04,0:42:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎她婚前姓班森 ‎有一处以这个姓为主的墓园\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's a family plot in her maiden name, Benson.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.83,0:43:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,‎那房子怎么处理\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What about the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.12,0:43:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎听着 不要把我牵扯进去\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Look, I don't want any part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.45,0:43:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我在丹佛已经忙得不可开交了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I got problems enough in Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.87,0:43:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎把她送回肯塔基州下葬 ‎房子归你了 只要...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Get her up to Kentucky and bury her, and the house is yours. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.04,0:43:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,‎定期还贷就行了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}make the mortgage payments.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.37,0:43:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,‎需要钱吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You need money?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.79,0:43:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,‎不清楚 我不知道要花多少钱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't know. I don't know how much it'll cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.66,0:43:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎听说你过得不错 新闻报道上铺天盖地的"神童"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I heard you're doing all right. The child-prodigy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.79,0:43:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎不能跟他们要钱吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Can't you charge it or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.37,0:43:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎我会叫酒店帮忙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll ask the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.79,0:43:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,‎很好 尽管去办吧 ‎我手头没有足够的钱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Good, you do that. I'm strapped for cash right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.33,0:43:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,‎但是你可以联系美国第二银行找厄利克先生\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}but call Second National Bank and ask for Mr. Erlich.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.79,0:43:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,厄运的"厄" 利益的"利" 克制的"克"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That's E-R-L-I-C-H.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.04,0:43:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,‎告诉他我把房子给你了 他知道怎么找我\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Tell him I want you to have the house. He knows how to reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.12,0:43:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,‎你不想知道她的死因吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Don't you want to know how she died?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.00,0:43:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,‎是什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.91,0:43:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,‎肝炎\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hepatitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.83,0:43:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是 明天才能确定\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I think. We'll know tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.29,0:43:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,‎好吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.79,0:43:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,‎她生前经常生病\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She was sick a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.16,0:45:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,‎多一点\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Más.

